          "number": "3(b)",
          "category": null,
          "questionText": "Write down the exact value of $\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{11\\pi}{4}\\right)$.",
          "questionFigures": [],
          "solution": {
            "formula": "Periodicity $\\cos(\\theta + 2\\pi) = \\cos\\theta$; $\\cos(\\pi - \\theta) = -\\cos\\theta$",
            "steps": [
              "Given: $\\dfrac{11\\pi}{4}$. Goal: exact cosine.",
              "$\\dfrac{11\\pi}{4} = 2\\pi + \\dfrac{3\\pi}{4}$, so $\\cos\\dfrac{11\\pi}{4} = \\cos\\dfrac{3\\pi}{4}$.",
              "$\\dfrac{3\\pi}{4} = \\pi - \\dfrac{\\pi}{4}$, so $\\cos\\dfrac{3\\pi}{4} = -\\cos\\dfrac{\\pi}{4} = -\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$."
            ],
            "finalAnswer": "$-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$",
            "solutionFigures": [],
            "tip": "Subtract $2\\pi = \\frac{8\\pi}{4}$ first to reach an angle in $[0, 2\\pi)$."
          }
        },
        {
